58663"},{"text":"Net cash of $478.6m against total assets of $2.2bn - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1769663/000110465926058663/0001104659-26-058663-index.htm","accession":"0001104659-26-058663"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (-2.4% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1769663/000110465926058663/0001104659-26-058663-index.htm","accession":"0001104659-26-058663"}],"bear":[{"text":"Insiders disposed of 4.9% of their combined holdings over the last four quarters (5,395 shares across 8 ownership filings). People with the best view of the business were reducing their stake.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1769663/000143774926024490/0001437749-26-024490-index.htm"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.4% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1769663/000143774926024490/0001437749-26-024490-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth falls below -10.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"revenue_growth_yoy","comparison":"below","threshold":-0.1,"consecutive":2,"current":0.052,"current_display":"5.2%","threshold_display":"-10.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"If growth halves and stays there, the reason you looked at this company has gone.","editable":true},{"id":"dilution_ceiling","kind":"metric","label":"Diluted share count growth rises above 10.0%","metric":"dilution_yoy","comparison":"above","threshold":0.1,"consecutive":1,"current":